              "id": "d1ec3fe",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"hero-block hero-block--variant-default alignfull\"><div class=\"hero-block__inner\"><div class=\"hero-block__content\"><div class=\"hero-block__eyebrow\">Jason &amp; Tyler Younker</div><h1 class=\"hero-block__headline\">You hate work you used to love.</h1><p class=\"hero-block__subheadline\">You can say that here.</p><div class=\"hero-block__body\"><p>You built a successful practice. It was supposed to fund your life — not be the thing that keeps you from living it. You're not ungrateful. You're trapped. And we know exactly how to get you out.</p></div><div class=\"hero-block__actions\"><a href=\"demo-contact.html\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--arrow\">Start the Conversation →</a><a href=\"demo-about.html\" class=\"btn btn--secondary\">Read Our Story →</a></div></div><div class=\"hero-block__media\"><div class=\"hero-block__image-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo of Jason and Tyler\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📸</span> Jason &amp; Tyler — candid photo\n        </div></div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
