              "id": "3b30c51",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"empathy-story alignfull\"><div class=\"empathy-story__inner\"><h2 class=\"empathy-story__headline reveal\">We know exactly what that feels like.</h2><div class=\"empathy-story__stories\"><div class=\"empathy-story__story reveal reveal-delay-1\"><div class=\"empathy-story__image-wrap\"><div class=\"empathy-story__image-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo of Tyler\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 240px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbe8f5 0%, #c5d9ee 100%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #5b6b84;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📸</span> Tyler's photo\n            </div></div><h3 class=\"empathy-story__story-title\">Tyler's Story</h3><div class=\"empathy-story__story-body\"><p>Tyler spent eight years in sales chasing a number nobody in company history had ever hit. The year she finally hit it, she wanted a marching band down the hall, cheerleaders, glitter falling from the sky. She got a congratulations email and a nice lunch. And in January, her ticker flipped back to zero.</p></div></div><div class=\"empathy-story__story reveal reveal-delay-2\"><div class=\"empathy-story__image-wrap\"><div class=\"empathy-story__image-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo of Jason\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 240px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbe8f5 0%, #c5d9ee 100%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #5b6b84;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📸</span> Jason's photo\n            </div></div><h3 class=\"empathy-story__story-title\">Jason's Story</h3><div class=\"empathy-story__story-body\"><p>Jason burned out on his IT career in 2017. He started driving Uber just to buy back a little freedom.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"empathy-story__connecting-line reveal reveal-delay-3\">\n        We know what it's like to have everything and hate your life anyway. We also know what it's like to get out.\n      </div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
