            {
              "id": "6855e68",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"authority-block alignfull\"><div class=\"authority-block__inner\"><h2 class=\"authority-block__headline reveal\">The way out we teach is the way we took.</h2><div class=\"authority-block__grid\"><div class=\"authority-block__credential reveal reveal-delay-1\"><div class=\"authority-block__credential-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🌍</div><h3 class=\"authority-block__credential-title\">Eight years of freedom</h3><div class=\"authority-block__credential-body\"><p>We traded careers for income-producing assets. We've been full-time travelers ever since, raising a five-year-old who thinks it's normal to ask which city she'll live in tomorrow.</p></div></div><div class=\"authority-block__credential reveal reveal-delay-2\"><div class=\"authority-block__credential-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🏛️</div><h3 class=\"authority-block__credential-title\">$3 billion — institutionally</h3><div class=\"authority-block__credential-body\"><p>Before that season, Tyler raised $3 billion institutionally — her clients were financial advisors and stockbrokers, never retail investors. Today she serves as a FINRA arbitrator.</p></div></div><div class=\"authority-block__credential reveal reveal-delay-3\"><div class=\"authority-block__credential-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎓</div><h3 class=\"authority-block__credential-title\">Certified Exit Planning Advisor</h3><div class=\"authority-block__credential-body\"><p>Jason is training as a Certified Exit Planning Advisor (CEPA). We've spent the years since our own escape building ownership models designed to buy other people the same freedom.</p></div></div></div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
