              "id": "c72e491",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"plan-steps alignfull\"><div class=\"plan-steps__inner\"><h2 class=\"plan-steps__headline reveal\">Here's how it works.</h2><p class=\"plan-steps__subheadline reveal reveal-delay-1\">Three steps. Not a program. A path.</p><div class=\"plan-steps__list\"><div class=\"plan-steps__step reveal reveal-delay-1\"><span class=\"plan-steps__step-number\">1</span><h3 class=\"plan-steps__step-title\">Say it out loud.</h3><div class=\"plan-steps__step-body\"><p>Admit how you really feel about the thing you built — to people who have felt it too. This is the hardest step, and the one you can't do alone.</p></div></div><div class=\"plan-steps__step reveal reveal-delay-2\"><span class=\"plan-steps__step-number\">2</span><h3 class=\"plan-steps__step-title\">Picture what replaces it.</h3><div class=\"plan-steps__step-body\"><p>Get concrete about the life you want next. What does it need to earn? Do you want the practice rebuilt around that life — or do you want to walk away? If you want to walk away, Exit to Client lets you sell to the people who already know exactly what it's worth: your clients.</p></div></div><div class=\"plan-steps__step reveal reveal-delay-3\"><span class=\"plan-steps__step-number\">3</span><h3 class=\"plan-steps__step-title\">Wake up wanting the day.</h3><div class=\"plan-steps__step-body\"><p>Every change we help you make points at that one outcome. Not a retirement number. Not a valuation multiple. A day you actually want to show up for.</p></div></div></div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
