            {
              "id": "2402601",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"success-failure-split alignfull\"><div class=\"success-failure-split__inner\"><h2 class=\"success-failure-split__headline reveal\">What winning looks like. What losing looks like.</h2><div class=\"success-failure-split__columns\"><div class=\"success-failure-split__column success-failure-split__column--success reveal reveal-delay-1\"><h3 class=\"success-failure-split__column-label\">What Winning Looks Like</h3><ul class=\"success-failure-split__list success-failure-split__list--success\"><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">You stop dreading the phone.</li><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">Your week fits around your life instead of the other way around.</li><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">Your income stops depending on your calendar.</li><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">You can answer \"what's next\" with something you can't wait to start.</li><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">When you do hand the practice off, it happens on your terms and your timeline.</li></ul></div><div class=\"success-failure-split__column success-failure-split__column--failure reveal reveal-delay-2\"><h3 class=\"success-failure-split__column-label\">What Losing Looks Like</h3><ul class=\"success-failure-split__list success-failure-split__list--failure\"><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">Keep white-knuckling toward a retirement date that keeps moving.</li><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">Let the practice keep eating evenings and weekends until health or family makes the decision for you.</li><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">Sell in a hurry to whoever shows up with a check, and watch thirty years of client relationships get scattered.</li><li class=\"success-failure-split__list-item\">Keep hating it quietly while everyone keeps congratulating you.</li></ul></div></div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
