              "id": "7353738",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"transformation-statement alignfull\"><div class=\"transformation-statement__inner\"><div class=\"transformation-statement__transform\"><span class=\"transformation-statement__from\">The perfect life on paper, and done inside.</span><span class=\"transformation-statement__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"transformation-statement__to\">A life that feels<br>as good as it looks.</span></div><div class=\"transformation-statement__body reveal\"><p>This is what we do. We help you cross that gap. Not with a framework. Not with a workbook. With a conversation, a plan, and a partner who's already been where you are.</p></div></div></div>"
