              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"cta-section alignfull\"><div class=\"cta-section__inner\"><h2 class=\"cta-section__headline reveal\">Ready to want the day again?</h2><div class=\"cta-section__body reveal reveal-delay-1\"><p>One conversation could change everything. No pressure. No pitch. Just honesty from people who have been there.</p></div><div class=\"cta-section__actions reveal reveal-delay-2\"><a href=\"demo-contact.html\" class=\"btn btn--white btn--arrow\">Start the Conversation →</a><a href=\"demo-newsletter.html\" class=\"btn btn--outline-white\">Join the Newsletter →</a></div><p class=\"cta-section__tagline reveal reveal-delay-3\">One list. From the two of us. About the next season.</p></div></div>"
